    <item>
      <title>Redmine Plugins &amp; Themes 介紹：那些我成功安裝的外掛</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 02 Mar 2021 15:11:01 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>團隊合作</category>
      <description>Redmine 的擴充性相當強，但是擴充性強是一回事，你能不能成功安裝是另外一回事；Redmine 版本不斷更新的同時，有許多的 plugins 也成為時代的眼淚，今天就來分享幾個我成功擴充並且實用的幾個 plugins & Theme。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-og_hu_e4161308cec0720d.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Redmine 的擴充性相當強，但是擴充性強是一回事，你能不能成功安裝是另外一回事；Redmine 版本不斷更新的同時，有許多的 plugins 也成為時代的眼淚，這篇文章將分享幾個我成功擴充並且實用的幾個 plugins &amp; Theme。</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-01.webp" width="1400" height="717" alt="這篇文章會介紹上面成功安裝的 plugins" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>這篇文章會介紹上面成功安裝的 plugins</figcaption>
</figure>

<pre tabindex="0"><code>一、Redmine Dashboard plugin
二、Redmine Checklists plugin (Light version)
三、Redmine Issues Tree plugin
四、Redmine Issue Templates plugin
五、Redmine Issue View Columns
六、Redmine Lightbox 2
七、Redmine Mentions
八、Redmine A1 theme
九、備註
</code></pre><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-02.webp" width="1400" height="782" alt="Redmine Plugins &amp; Themes 介紹：那些我成功安裝的外掛（圖 2）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="提供安裝套件時的參數給大家參考">提供安裝套件時的參數給大家參考：<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e6%8f%90%e4%be%9b%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d%e5%a5%97%e4%bb%b6%e6%99%82%e7%9a%84%e5%8f%83%e6%95%b8%e7%b5%a6%e5%a4%a7%e5%ae%b6%e5%8f%83%e8%80%83" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<blockquote>
<p>rvm version：1.29.12</p>
<p>ruby version：2.6.6</p>
<p>Redmine version：4.1.1</p>
<p>這篇文章是介紹套件為主，如果你想知道怎麼安裝可以<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/">參考『Redmine 超詳細安裝教學』的 STEP 9</a></p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="一redmine-dashboard-plugin">一、Redmine Dashboard plugin<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80redmine-dashboard-plugin" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/jgraichen/redmine_dashboard">https://github.com/jgraichen/redmine_dashboard</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>這是一款必須安裝的套件！透過 <strong>看板的呈現 讓</strong>使用者更能全盤掌握專案的進度、利用<strong> Filter 條件</strong>篩選出想要的議題、直覺的 <strong>拖拉議題</strong> 改變狀態</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-03.webp" width="1400" height="747" alt="卡片版" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>卡片版</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-04.webp" width="1400" height="597" alt="精簡版" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>精簡版</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-05.webp" width="1400" height="597" alt="可以做進度更新、指派任務的動作" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>可以做進度更新、指派任務的動作</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="二redmine-checklists-plugin-light-version">二、Redmine Checklists plugin (Light version)<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8credmine-checklists-plugin-light-version" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://www.redmineup.com/pages/plugins/checklists">https://www.redmineup.com/pages/plugins/checklists</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>有時一個議題內容比較複雜的時候，除了新增子議題外，你也可以用 Checklist 的方式來提醒自己有哪些任務需要完成。</p>
<p>另外<strong>對於測試人員來說這個 Checklist 的功能是非常有幫助的</strong>，可以用來幫助他們紀錄已經測試過的項目及更精準的追蹤測試進度。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-06.webp" width="1400" height="767" alt="二、Redmine Checklists plugin (Light version)（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><strong>備註</strong>：套件可設定除非 <strong>Checklist 全部打勾 </strong>才能關閉議題</p>
<h2 id="三redmine-issues-tree-plugin">三、Redmine Issues Tree plugin<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%89redmine-issues-tree-plugin" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/Loriowar/redmine_issues_tree">https://github.com/Loriowar/redmine_issues_tree</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>這個套件在一個專案議題數量很多的時候幫助很大，透過樹狀圖的顯示每個議題之間的關係讓使用者找到所需資源</p>
<p><strong>Before</strong>：在系統預設的畫面會顯得有點混亂</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-07.webp" width="1400" height="627" alt="三、Redmine Issues Tree plugin（圖 7）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><strong>After</strong>：樹狀圖檢視降低閱讀壓力</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-08.webp" width="1400" height="627" alt="三、Redmine Issues Tree plugin（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="四redmine-issue-templates-plugin">四、Redmine Issue Templates plugin<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e5%9b%9bredmine-issue-templates-plugin" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/agileware-jp/redmine_issue_templates">https://github.com/Loriowar/redmine_issues_tree</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>專案進行時最害怕開議題時每個人的風格都不一樣，並且對於議題的描述不夠精準忘東忘西；本套件就是為了減少這部分的溝通成本，<strong>讓每個參與者都必須依照特定格式來新增議題/筆記</strong>。</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-09.webp" width="1268" height="332" alt="管理者可以決定問題樣板的作用範圍" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>管理者可以決定問題樣板的<strong>作用範圍</strong></figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-10.webp" width="1400" height="770" alt="使用者可以依照專案去新增樣板，並設定是否要成為預設值" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>使用者可以<strong>依照專案</strong>去新增樣板，並設定是否要成為<strong>預設值</strong></figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-11.webp" width="1400" height="386" alt="使用者可以去調整樣板的優先順序" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>使用者可以去調整樣板的<strong>優先順序</strong></figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-12.webp" width="1400" height="408" alt="這樣新增議題時便會有統一的格式" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>這樣新增議題時便會有<strong>統一的格式</strong></figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="五redmine-issue-view-columns">五、Redmine Issue View Columns<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%94redmine-issue-view-columns" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/kenan3008/redmine_issue_view_columns">https://github.com/kenan3008/redmine_issue_view_columns</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>這個套件是設定議題下面<strong>子議題要呈現哪些欄位</strong>的 Plugin</p>
<p><strong>Before</strong>：原本呈現的資訊不符合使用者的實際需求，且有些欄位不清楚作用</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-13.webp" width="1400" height="451" alt="五、Redmine Issue View Columns（圖 13）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><strong>After</strong>：自訂想要呈現的欄位，欄位功能清晰</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-14.webp" width="780" height="494" alt="五、Redmine Issue View Columns（圖 14）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-15.webp" width="1400" height="471" alt="五、Redmine Issue View Columns（圖 15）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="六redmine-lightbox-2">六、Redmine Lightbox 2<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e5%85%adredmine-lightbox-2" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/paginagmbh/redmine_lightbox2">https://github.com/paginagmbh/redmine_lightbox2</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>有時議題會附加一些照片、PDF 做為參考資料，原本預設這些附加檔案都需要下載或是開新分頁才能閱讀，安裝這個外掛後就能透過<strong>預覽檢視照片、PDF</strong></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-16.webp" width="749" height="243" alt="六、Redmine Lightbox 2（圖 16）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-17.webp" width="1400" height="758" alt="六、Redmine Lightbox 2（圖 17）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="七redmine-mentions">七、Redmine Mentions<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%83redmine-mentions" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://github.com/arkhitech/redmine_mentions">https://github.com/arkhitech/redmine_mentions</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>我們在<strong>撰寫議題描述/筆記</strong>時常常需要提到某些人(會議決策者、功能開發人員…)，讓這些人了解目前議題執行的進度，或是紀錄他們說過的話。</p>
<p>加入這個套件之後可以透過 <code>@someone_name</code> 的方式標記對方</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-18.webp" width="1272" height="832" alt="七、Redmine Mentions（圖 18）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>如果希望被標記時也會收到信件，要調整帳號設定如下</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-19.webp" width="1400" height="622" alt="七、Redmine Mentions（圖 19）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-20.webp" width="1220" height="464" alt="會收到長這個樣子的信件" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>會收到長這個樣子的信件</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="八redmine-a1-theme">八、Redmine A1 theme<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e5%85%abredmine-a1-theme" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>Resource：<a href="https://www.redmineup.com/pages/zh/themes">https://www.redmineup.com/pages/zh/themes</a></p>
<p>推薦程度：⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>
</blockquote>
<p>如果覺得系統預設的主題(Theme)太醜，可以到<a href="https://www.redmineup.com/pages/zh/themes">這個網站</a>上找自己喜歡的主題</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-21.webp" width="1400" height="771" alt="八、Redmine A1 theme（圖 21）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>我這次選擇的是 <a href="https://www.redmineup.com/pages/themes/a1">A1主題</a> ，如果要<strong>更換主題需要由管理者做設定喔</strong>！</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-22.webp" width="1400" height="441" alt="八、Redmine A1 theme（圖 22）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-23.webp" width="1400" height="521" alt="八、Redmine A1 theme（圖 23）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="九備註">九、備註<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b9%9d%e5%82%99%e8%a8%bb" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>今天所操作的這些 plugins <strong>有些是默認全域作用、有些是針對專案作用</strong>，如果你發現 Plugin 安裝成功但是沒看到功能時請依照下面的步驟打開 Plugin：</p>
<h3 id="step-1進入專案清單">STEP 1：進入專案清單<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-1%e9%80%b2%e5%85%a5%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88%e6%b8%85%e5%96%ae" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-24.webp" width="1400" height="526" alt="STEP 1：進入專案清單（圖 24）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="step-2選擇你要設定的專案">STEP 2：選擇你要設定的專案<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-2%e9%81%b8%e6%93%87%e4%bd%a0%e8%a6%81%e8%a8%ad%e5%ae%9a%e7%9a%84%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-25.webp" width="1400" height="526" alt="STEP 2：選擇你要設定的專案（圖 25）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="step-3設定專案">STEP 3：設定專案<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-3%e8%a8%ad%e5%ae%9a%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-26.webp" width="1400" height="526" alt="STEP 3：設定專案（圖 26）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="step-4滑到下面選擇啟用模組並儲存">STEP 4：滑到下面選擇啟用模組並儲存<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-4%e6%bb%91%e5%88%b0%e4%b8%8b%e9%9d%a2%e9%81%b8%e6%93%87%e5%95%9f%e7%94%a8%e6%a8%a1%e7%b5%84%e4%b8%a6%e5%84%b2%e5%ad%98" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202103/redmine-plugins-and-themes/images/redmine-plugins-and-themes-27.webp" width="1400" height="747" alt="STEP 4：滑到下面選擇啟用模組並儲存（圖 27）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
